OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for UK's longest and highest
OL,4,Atoboggan ride approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for the UK's longest and highest
OL,7,Ftoboggan ride have been approved for
OL,8,Fthe Cairngorm Mountain resort near
OL,9,FAviemore.
OL,11,FAlmost a mile of track would carry
OL,12,Friders on two-seater sleds down an
OL,13,Faluminium monorail from a point about
OL,14,F2,513ft (766m) above sea level.
OL,16,FThe project has been given the go-ahead
OL,17,Fby the Cairngorms National Park
OL,18,FAuthority's planning committee.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
